# Crypto Watcher — Frontend

> Phase tags (`MVP`, `Phase 1`, `Phase 2`, `Phase 3`, `Final`) cite
> [ROADMAP](./ROADMAP.mdc). The UI consumes the API in [BACKEND](./BACKEND.mdc)
> and reads on-chain data/contracts in [CONTRACTS](./CONTRACTS.mdc). Keep this
> file in sync with the actual `apps/web/` implementation (see the docs-sync rule
> in `.cursor/rules/`).

## Tech Stack

From the [README](../README.md): Vite + React + TypeScript + TailwindCSS,
Shadcn/UI (fully rounded, Uber-inspired cream/yellow palette), Zustand, React Hook Form,
React Router, Sonner, Remix Icons, Raleway font. Web3: RainbowKit, Wagmi, Viem.
Tests: Vitest + Testing Library (unit/integration) and Playwright (e2e). Monorepo via Nx + pnpm.

## Modular Folder Structure

The web app is feature-modular. Each feature owns its components, hooks, store
slice, API client and tests. Shared primitives live under `components/ui`
(Shadcn) and `lib/`.

```
apps/
└── web/
    ├── index.html
    ├── vite.config.ts
    ├── src/
    │   ├── main.tsx                 # App bootstrap + providers
    │   ├── app/
    │   │   ├── router.tsx           # React Router routes
    │   │   ├── providers.tsx        # Wagmi/RainbowKit/Query/Theme providers
    │   │   └── layout/              # Shared app shell, nav/search, footer
    │   ├── components/
    │   │   └── ui/                  # Shadcn/UI primitives (shared)
    │   ├── lib/                     # api client, wagmi/viem config, utils
    │   │   ├── api/                 # typed API client (maps to BACKEND)
    │   │   ├── web3/                # wagmi config, contract ABIs/hooks
    │   │   └── utils/
    │   ├── store/                   # Zustand root store + shared slices
    │   ├── modules/                 # Feature modules
    │   │   ├── projects/            # Safety index + project detail   [MVP]
    │   │   │   ├── components/
    │   │   │   ├── hooks/
    │   │   │   ├── api/
    │   │   │   ├── lib/             # Formatting, curated refs, icon paths, CoinGecko ids
    │   │   │   ├── store.ts         # Zustand slice
    │   │   │   ├── routes.tsx
    │   │   │   └── __tests__/
    │   │   ├── marketing/           # Public landing page             [MVP]
    │   │   ├── docs/                # Product docs pages              [MVP]
    │   │   ├── comments/            # Public commenting               [MVP]
    │   │   ├── auth/                # Email/password + wallet onboarding  [MVP]
    │   │   ├── analysis/            # In Analysis queue + review requests [MVP]
    │   │   ├── profile/             # Unified user profile page           [MVP]
    │   │   ├── voting/              # On-chain voting UI               [MVP]
    │   │   ├── scoring/             # Score display/visualization      [MVP]
    │   │   ├── market/              # Price chart + change badges      [MVP]
    │   │   ├── governance/         # Proposals, vote, results          [MVP]
    │   │   ├── reputation/         # Reputation profile/eligibility    [MVP→Phase 1]
    │   │   ├── rewards/            # Voter rewards UI                  [Phase 1]
    │   │   └── notifications/      # In-app notification center        [Phase 1]
    │   ├── styles/                  # Tailwind base + theme
    │   └── public/                  # Static assets (logos, `/icons/{slug}.png` coin logos)
    ├── e2e/                         # Playwright tests
    └── package.json
```

> Each feature is self-contained: components/hooks/api/store/tests. Cross-feature
> sharing goes through `lib/`, `components/ui/` or `store/`, never by importing
> another feature's internals.

## Features by Phase

### projects `[MVP]`
- Public safety index with top-nav/landing search and project detail page.
- Curated market-reference assets inspired by widely tracked CoinMarketCap listings.
- Local coin logos in `public/icons/{slug}.png` (synced from CoinGecko via `pnpm --filter web icons:sync`); `ProjectIcon` loads by slug with initials fallback.
- Lifecycle status badges (`In analysis → Ready → Voting → Closed → Analyzed`).
- Score visualization on the detail page.
- Price movement panel on reference project detail (7-day chart, 24h/7d change; React Query stale time matches 3h API cache).
- Community submission form. `[Phase 2]`

### market `[MVP]`
- `ProjectPricePanel` on curated reference detail pages (24h, 7d, 1m, 1y change badges).
- `TopRatedProjectCard` on the landing hero (description, tags, price, 24h/7d/1m/1y changes, compact sparkline).
- SVG sparkline chart (`PriceChart`) with 1D/1W/1M/1Y range filters, hover crosshair, and green/red tone from period direction.
- `useMarketPrice` hook calling `GET /market/projects/:slug`, with a CoinGecko client fallback (3h `localStorage` cache) when the API is unreachable in dev.

### comments `[MVP]`
- Public comment thread (read by all, post when authenticated).
- Small per-comment fee explained in UI (anti-spam); on-chain fee settlement `[MVP]` (UI + backend flag).

### auth `[MVP]`
- Email/password registration and login with session cookies, on a split-panel branded auth shell.
- Forgot-password and reset-password flow (token-based; dev surfaces the link until email infra ships).
- Guided multi-step onboarding teaching search, safety scores, comments/reviews, and optional wallet linking.
- Public-key (wallet) linking for governance-token voting.
- Wallet connect via RainbowKit lives inside the logged-in profile dropdown (not the top nav).

### analysis `[MVP]`
- **In Analysis** page: community review requests + on-chain projects awaiting POA authority votes.
- **Analysis Request** page: authenticated users submit projects for paid protocol review.

### profile `[MVP]`
- Unified profile page (`/app/profile`): PFP, nickname, X account, bio, public key, governor badge for authorities.

### voting `[MVP]`
- Cast votes on a project's contract via Wagmi/Viem.
- Eligibility-aware UI (disable/explain when not eligible).
- Tiered vote-weight display. `[Phase 1]`

### scoring `[MVP]`
- Score breakdown + charts.
- Enriched external-signal display. `[Phase 3]`

### governance — launch requirement
- View proposals, cast governance votes, see results (Governor + token). `[MVP]`
- Community proposal creation UI. `[Phase 1]`
- Vote delegation UX (`ERC20Votes`). `[Phase 2]`
- Full DAO/treasury dashboards. `[Final]`

### reputation `[MVP → Phase 1]`
- Show eligibility + basic reputation. `[MVP]`
- Detailed multi-factor reputation profile. `[Phase 1]`

### rewards `[Phase 1]`
- Display earned rewards and slashing history.

### notifications `[Phase 1]`
- In-app notification center for lifecycle + governance events.

### Platform & UX
- Uber-inspired light theme (cream/yellow/black), Raleway font, fully rounded Shadcn components; blueprint grid background on all pages. `[MVP]`
- Global shell: brand + nav links | ⌘K search + theme toggle + auth CTA; site footer on all pages (landing + app) with product/resources/account links and CTA to request review. `[MVP]`
- Command palette search (debounced, race-conditioned) over 100 curated + live projects. `[MVP]`
- Toasts via Sonner, icons via Remix Icon, forms via React Hook Form. `[MVP]`
- Error reporting via Sentry. `[MVP]`
- Embeddable score widgets/badges. `[Phase 3]`
- PWA / mobile experience. `[Phase 3]`

## Functional Requirements (by feature & phase)

### projects `[MVP]`
- R1: Browse and search a public safety index without connecting a wallet.
- R2: View a project detail page with lifecycle status and score.
- R3: Team UI to create/update/transition projects. `[MVP]` (role-gated `[Phase 2]`)
- R4: Community submission form. `[Phase 2]`

### comments `[MVP]`
- R1: Read comment threads without auth; post/delete-own when authenticated.

### auth `[MVP]`
- R1: Connect wallet (RainbowKit), SIWE login, session-aware UI, logout.

### voting `[MVP]`
- R1: Show eligibility; enable voting only for eligible wallets.
- R2: Cast votes through the project's contract (Wagmi/Viem) with tx feedback (Sonner).
- R3: Display live tallies + reputation-weighted results.

### scoring `[MVP]`
- R1: Visualize the score and its breakdown; show per-round history.

### governance `[MVP]` — launch requirement
- R1: List proposals, view detail, cast governance votes, see results.
- R2: Create proposals. `[Phase 1]` Delegate votes. `[Phase 2]`

### reputation `[MVP → Phase 1]`
- R1: Show eligibility + basic reputation `[MVP]`; full factor breakdown `[Phase 1]`.

### rewards / notifications `[Phase 1]`
- R1: Show earned rewards/slashing; in-app notification center.

